// Windows Defender AMSI Trigger Detected | T1059 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/builtin/windefend/win_defender_malware_detected_amsi_source.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where winlog.channel=="Microsoft-Windows-Windows Defender/Operational" and event.code=="1116" and winlog.event_data.SourceName=="AMSI"
